FEATURED RECIPE MAIN TEXT

Chicken shawarma is packed with delicious Middle Eastern flavours. 
Tender, juicy chicken is marinated with a blend of garlic, lemon, paprika, 
cumin and warm spices, then cooked until golden and slightly crispy. 
Served over fluffy rice with fresh vegetables, creamy garlic sauce and warm pita bread, 
this meal is full of flavour. Perfect for lunch or dinner, and great for leftovers!

